                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2566: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commissioner in the
                        Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-08-14T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                                1922—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>2. Department approves modifications in plan signed in Washington as stated in
                    your No. 8, August 12, 2 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
